Package: ivms4200-lite
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libvlc5 (>= 3.0.0), libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libxcb-xinerama0, libfontconfig1, libglib2.0-0
Recommends: libvlc-bin
Maintainer: IVMS4200-Lite Maintainers <maintainer@example.com>
Description: Lightweight IVMS-4200-like video surveillance client
 A simplified desktop client inspired by Hikvision IVMS-4200, focused on
 real-time RTSP video preview. Features:
  * Camera management (IP/port/user/pass) with edit/delete/connection test
  * ONVIF WS-Discovery auto discovery and PTZ control
  * 1/4/9 and custom split layouts, up to 9 channels preview
  * Snapshot capture, local recording, recording plans
  * Cross-platform (Windows / Linux)
